{
  "_comment": [
    "The oracle corpus (AR-VER-209, docs/quality/VERIFICATION_PLAN.md): programs run in Arare and in the pinned",
    "Ajisai build, compared by scripts/check-oracle.mjs. Arare's values must lie within the error budget the",
    "checker infers (AR-HLR-027) of Ajisai's exact ones. `budget` is the largest budget the checker may infer for",
    "any value of the case, worked out by hand from the rounding points the program passes through (ADR-0008).",
    "A case with `divergence` is one where Arare differs from Ajisai on purpose (ADR-0007): the harness checks",
    "that Arare answers `arare` and that Ajisai still answers something else. Since Ajisai 1.0.0-beta.4 (SELECT",
    "on UNKNOWN takes ELSE, SUM skips NIL) the only kind left is `overflow`."
